    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, “Yaga ku'mwa Falao. Ene namuv'ezyaga av'e na moyo mulambu haki'mo na v'akumba v'akwe ki'gele mbezye lu'manyi'lo lwa migaka mugati' nav'o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' na inywe mwize muv'atentemuli'le v'ana na v'izu'ku'lu' v'inywe, i'vyo nav'av'ezezizye V'amisili ku' wu'daki, na ku'v'ezya lu'manyi'lo lwa migaka mugati' nav'o. Hu' i'vyo mulamanye ku'v'a ene ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Mose na Aloni v'ayaga ku'mwa Falao na v'amuwi'laga, “Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wa V'aebulania, ali'yomba i'vi: ‘Mpaka nanali' u'kwendeleya ku'kaana kwitunia ha mbele yanne? V'aleku'li'le v'antu' v'anne v'awu'ke, ki'gele v'akanyisenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lu' u'kaane ku'v'aleku'li'la v'antu' v'anne v'awu'ke, nhana, igolo ndalete nzige ziyi'tinge nsi' yako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nsi' yose ya Misili yi'lakumbwe na nzige zyeni'zyo mpaka yi'laleke kwigela. Zilalye ki'la chene i'cho chasigali'lile ha itungo lya nvula i'yo ya mawe. Hangi' zilalye ki'la madu'tu' ago gafulumile ku' miti' mu migu'nda zinywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzige zyeni'zyo zilokale mu nnumba zyako, mu nnumba zya v'akumba v'ako na zya V'amisili v'ose. Zilav'e na wingi u'wo ninga v'a sinywe na v'agu'ku' v'inywe v'akaali' v'awonage ku'fuma ku'v'yalwa kwav'o mpaka walelo.’ ” Hohene Mose wahafumaga hamwa Falao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'akumba v'amwa Falao v'amuwu'zyaga, “Vihe, muntu' mwenu'yu' alaku'tusye mpaka nanali'? V'aleku'li'le v'antu' v'enav'a v'awu'ke v'aye v'akamwisenge Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wav'o. Vihe, u'kaali' ku'manya ku'v'a nsi' yakav'ipa?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Mose na Aloni v'itanagwa v'asu'v'e ku'mwa Falao, nawe wav'awi'laga ati', “Yagi mukamwisenge Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe. Ali'vi nu'wu'zya, v'a nde muku'ya nav'o?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose wasu'v'yaga ati', “Ku'ku'ya na v'asu'mbana na v'aniki', v'anamala na v'akiku'lu', haki'mo na v'ana v'iswe v'a ki'ki'ma na v'a ki'gosya, haki'mo na ng'ombe, nkolo na mbu'li ziswe zyose. Ku'ku'ya iswe v'ose ku'nguno ku'li'kamuv'ezezya mwanya Gu'ku' Mulungu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Falao wav'awi'laga ati', “Gu'ku' Mulungu av'e haki'mo na inywe, u'lu' muleku'li'le muwu'ke haki'mo na v'aki' v'inywe na v'ana v'inywe. Yi'manyi'kile ku'v'a muli' na ndaka mbi mu myoyo zinywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayi' ng'o yi'kakowoleka! V'agosya du' av'o v'aku'ya ku'kamwisenga Gu'ku' Mulungu, ku'nguno lyeni'lo hu' lyene muli'lombaga.” Haho Aloni na Mose v'asagagwa ha mbele ya minso gamwa Falao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, “Golola mukono gwako mu igu'lya na nsi' ya Misili, ki'gele nzige ziyi'kumbe nsi', na ku'lya mimelo zyose i'zyo zyasigalile ha itungo lya nvula ya mawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene wawu'syaga mulanga gwakwe na ku'gu'sunga ha igu'lya na nsi' ya Misili. Gu'ku' Mulungu waletaga muyaga ku'fuma mu ki'ya, na gwayumaga lyu'v'a zelele wu'ziku'pee. Aho wu'ziku' wasyaga muyaga gwenu'go gwaletaga nzige. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzige zyayi'kumbaga Misili yose na zyasambalaga hose mu nsi'. Nzige zyeni'zyo zyav'age idale ihanya muno, li'kaali' kwigela idale ki'ti' lyeni'lo na li'kasye ligele hangi'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzige zyeni'zyo zyayi'kumbaga nsi' yose ya Misili, mpaka nsi' yose yav'aga giti. Zyalyaga mimelo zyose na visumo vyose vya ku' miti' i'vyo ndi' vyasigali'lile ha itungo lya nvula ya mawe. Hadu'hu' idu'tu' ninga li'mo i'lo ndi' lyasigali'la ku' miti' ninga ku' ki'la mumelo mu nsi' ya Misili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Falao wav'itanaga Mose na Aloni wangu', na ku'v'awi'la, “Nav'ezyaga wu'kenagu'zi ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe, na ku' winywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'nguno yeni'yo nu'mulomba muntondole wu'kenagu'zi wanne kenaka du'. Mukandombele ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe, ansini'zye lu'fu lwenu'lu'.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Mose wawu'kaga hamwa Falao, na wamulombaga Gu'ku' Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Gu'ku' Mulungu wagalu'laga muyaga ku'v'a mudaki gu'fumi'i'le mu mweli, nago gwaziwu'syaga nzige zyose na ku'zipepemuli'la mu Nyanza ya Shamu. Ku'du'hu' nzige ninga yi'mo i'yo ndi' yasigali'la mu nsi' yose ya Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi Gu'ku' Mulungu wagu'v'ezyaga moyo gwamwa Falao ku'v'a mulambu, nawe Falao akav'aleku'li'lile V'aizilaeli v'awu'ke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, “Golola mukono gwako mu igu'lya mu ilunde, ki'gele yi'v'eho giti totolo mu nsi' yose ya Misili, i'yo yi'ku'v'av'ezya v'antu' v'apalapasye mu giti.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Mose wawu'syaga mukono gwakwe mu igu'lya mu ilunde, na giti nhanya yayi'kumbaga nsi' yose ya Misili ku' nsiku' idatu'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'antu' v'alekaga kwiwona, ninga ku'segezya ku'fuma aho ki'la mwene yamusangi'laga giti ku' nsiku' zyeni'zyo idatu'. Ali'vi V'aizilaeli v'ose v'av'age na mwanga ku' Gosheni u'ko ndi' v'ikalile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
