          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Falao wamwitanaga Mose, wamuwi'laga, “Yagi mukamwisenge Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe, v'aki' v'inywe na v'ana v'inywe muyage nav'o. Ali'vi ng'ombe, nkolo na mbu'li zinywe muzileke.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi Mose wasu'v'yaga ati', “Yi'li'ku'dima u'ku'leku'li'le ku'sole na ndimu zya vitaambo vya ku'zigya na zya vitaambo vingi', ki'gele ku'kamwisenge Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wiswe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yi'li'ku'dima ku'wu'ke na mitugo ziswe, ku'du'hu' chu'ga ninga ki'mo cha ku'sigala. Ku'nguno mugati' na mitugo zyeni'zyo ku'kamanya i'zyo zili'koov'iwa ku'mufumi'zya Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wiswe, ki'taambo. Ku' itungo lyeni'li' ku'kaali' ku'manya ndimu zya Ku'sogola mpaka aho ku'lafike kwenu'ko.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
