          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi Gu'ku' Mulungu wagu'v'ezyaga moyo gwamwa Falao ku'v'a mulambu. Falao wakaanaga ku'v'aleku'li'la V'aizilaeli v'awu'ke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Hafume ha mbele yanne! Wiangali'le muno. Ku'du' wize u'mbone hangi'. Lu'siku' u'lize ha mbele yanne u'lafwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose wasu'v'yaga ati', “Yi'v'age ki'ti' i'vi wayombaga. Nkasye nize ku'ku'wona hangi'!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.29"
            ]
          }
        }
